Problem 2 — AWS Credentials Missing
Test-Path "$env:USERPROFILE\.aws\credentials" → False
Create the credentials file:

powershell
# Create .aws folder
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path "$env:USERPROFILE\.aws"
# Create credentials file - replace with REAL values
@"
[default]
aws_access_key_id = YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_HERE
aws_secret_access_key = YOUR_SECRET_KEY_HERE
aws_session_token = YOUR_SESSION_TOKEN_IF_ANY
region = ap-south-1
"@ | Set-Content "$env:USERPROFILE\.aws\credentials"
Get the real AWS keys from your team/AWS console.

